/// Provides information about one or more of your managed nodes, including
/// the operating system platform, SSM Agent version, association status,
/// and IP address. This operation does not return information for nodes
/// that are either Stopped or Terminated. If you specify one or more node
/// IDs, the operation returns information for those managed nodes. If you
/// don't specify node IDs, it returns information for all your managed
/// nodes. If you specify a node ID that isn't valid or a node that you
